    "data": {
      "text": "Install all required packages sudo apt install cmake libopenblas-dev libeigen3-dev\n\n#### macOS Systems\n\nInstall [Homebrew] https://brew.sh/ if you don't have it already, then run:\n\nInstall all required packages brew install cmake openblas eigen libomp lapack\n\nTroubleshooting Homebrew: If you encounter installation errors, try these steps: ``bash # Fix permissions issues\n\nsudo chown -R $(whoami) /usr/local/Cellar # Fix shallow clone issues\n\ngit -C /usr/local/Homebrew/Library/Taps/homebrew/homebrew-core fetch --unshallow # Remove Java dependencies if they cause conflicts\n\nbrew uninstall --ignore-dependencies java brew update ``\n\n#### RHEL/CentOS/Fedora Systems",
